From 2539dafa803ed085fb3f6b5a3d36f1dc566bea78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ammar ELWazir <3832908+ammarwa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:00:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] TensileLite: preserve gfx1250-strict compiler target

Rebased onto rocm-libraries 271344a472037d303d5220eea2b14fd2ac01c1e5. Keep gfx1250v0 as the logic-selection identity while compiling and storing a separate gfx1250-strict device library.
---
